spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/TRACK.md:81:- On the LOCAL database (migration 
`supabase/migrations/20261007114454_message_create_budgets_insert_quota.sql`, written + applied locally, revised in 
place twice (r1, r2) with header rollback + reapply each time, NOT online): the insertion quota ('message:create', 
30/60 s) is charged by `private.charge_message_insertion_quota` (SECURITY DEFINER, search_path '', service_role only) 
as the last step of a winning insertion inside `public.create_message_attempt` (now 11 arguments: + 
`p_insert_quota_limit`, `p_insert_quota_window_seconds`): per-user lock held to commit, window read from the clock 
after the lock, then older windows deleted. Replays, lost same-key races and refused creates are never charged; 
RATE_LIMITED / RATE_LIMIT_UNAVAILABLE roll back the insertion and its attachment links.
spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/TRACK.md:86:- Routes: `POST /api/messages/create` authenticates, then 
charges 'message:create-request' (60/60 s) in its own transaction before parsing the body (malformed, validation 
failures, replays, quota losers all charged; survives insertion rollback; 401 charges nobody). `POST 
/api/messages/fence` charges 'message:fence' (90/60 s, was 60; the T2 fail-open limiter is replaced) on every 
authenticated call; the fence step of a generation-carrying create charges it too. These three budgets fail closed 
(RPC error, revoked/missing function, non-boolean → 429); react/upload/upload-cancel/read-receipts keep their 
fail-open limits.
spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/TRACK.md:100:- Performer (r0): the 9 initial budget tests all failed 
against T2 code+DB (replay counter 8 vs 2; request budget 0 vs 12; boundary counter 37 vs 30; 201 where 429 expected 
under limiter failure). They cover: replay not charged; request-budget charging of 
malformed/early-validation/replay/loser; rollback survival; fence budget incl. the create fence step; 8 concurrent 
same-key requests charged once (both variants); 10 distinct keys with 3 slots → exactly 3 stored + 7×429 (counter 30); 
revoked check_rate_limit → 429 on create (keyed/unkeyed/malformed) and fence with react still 200; counter unavailable 
in-transaction → 429 and nothing stored.
spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/TRACK.md:101:- Performer (r1): 4 new tests failed on r0 (client direct 
